     *  path — same physical, no validity), true otherwise (a fresh nullable
     *  column, source nulls preserved, absent rows null). A utf8 column
     *  cannot go nullable (no @Nullable Utf8 physical), so null-extending
     *  one is a loud error — the frame validates this at plan build; this
     *  is the executor backstop. */
